Package: c4e
Type: Package
Title: Climate Data for Economists: Linking Geospatial Data to Surveys
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "JMR",
      email = "jan.rossi@fao.org",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Extracts climate data at survey locations and administrative
    divisions, computes weather extreme indicators (threshold and percentile
    days, spells, heatwaves, standardised precipitation indices) and
    summarises them over the reference period before each interview. Tables
    carry their context, such as variable, unit, time step and thresholds,
    from one step to the next. Successor of 'climatic4economist'.
